QuestGuidance.Register("en",177,{
[5633]="70018E1E\n1\tDefeat the leader of the intruders in Fulz-zahar\tThe entrance to Fulz-zahar lies within Gharâf-fehem. Hersir has asked you to defeat leader of the intruders within Fulz-zahar\n2\tTalk to Hersir at Gharâf-fehem\tHersir is at Gharâf-fehem. You should return to Hersir at Gharâf-fehem in the Redhorn Lodes.\n",
[5634]="7004E145\n1\tComplete 'A Sunny Faire Day' (total: 4)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Farmers Faire Festival. Come and join everyone and participate in many Farmers Faire activities for four days!\n2\tTalk to Campanula Chubb\tCampanula Chubb would like to thank you for your continued participation in the Farmers Faire.\n",
[5635]="7004E146\n1\tComplete 'A Sunny Faire Day' (total: 4)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Farmers Faire Festival. Come and join everyone and participate in many Farmers Faire activities for four days!\n2\tTalk to Campanula Chubb\tCampanula Chubb would like to thank you for your continued participation in the Farmers Faire.\n",
[5636]="7004E149\n1\tComplete 'A Sunny Faire Day' (total: 4)\tEvery day there is something to do during the Farmers Faire. Come and join everyone and participate in many Farmers Faire activities for four days!\n2\tTalk to Campanula Chubb\tCampanula Chubb would like to thank you for your continued participation in the Farmers Faire Festival.\n",
[5637]="700375D8\n1\tSpeak with Burnoth and the Riders about Léofdag's heroism at the Battle of the Hornburg\tBurnoth is at the Hornburg. Burnoth wants you to join in the memorial for Léofdag, who fell at the Battle of the Hornburg.\n2\tTalk to Burnoth\tBurnoth is at the Hornburg. You should speak with Burnoth again.\n",
[5638]="70016BA0\n1\tOpen cages (total: 6)\030Defeat Morroval-slayers at Tith-maudhûl (total: 6)\tThe morroval-camp is at Tith-maudhûl, east of the Fanged Pit camp. Bési asked you to free the infected Orcs from their cages and defeat any merrevail in the camp who might also be infected.\n2\tTalk to Bési at the Fanged Pit camp\tBési is at the Fanged Pit camp west of Tith-maudhûl. Bési will be pleased to know that you freed the infected Orcs from the cages and killed any merrevail that have been infected.\n",
[5639]="700164CD\n1\tRestore paddles with the acid (quantity: see journal)\030Remove the slime from the main paddle (quantity: see journal)\tThe water-wheel is located at the Great Wheel, south-west of Hulwul-nefekh. The paddles above the wheel are covered with fungus and slime. For the great wheel to work once more, the paddles must function.\n2\tTalk to Ansurr in Hulwul-nefekh\tAnsurr is at Hulwul-nefekh, north-east of the Great Wheel. Ansurr will be pleased to know the fungus and slime has been removed from around the water wheel, and it is ready to run once more.\n",
[5640]="70016B27\n1\tTalk to Tyki at the Shadowed Refuge\tTyki is at the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone, far to the south-east of the Twenty-first Hall. Káti believes his friend Tyki at the Shadowed Refuge may know more about the fungus.\n",
[5641]="7005A41C\n1\tCollect wolf pelts (total: 8)\030Collect bear pelts (total: 8)\030Collect Warg pelts (total: 8)\tBears, Wargs, and wolves can be found throughout the woods of Azanulbizar. Aboki has tasked you with collecting animal pelts to help keep the army warm.\n2\tTalk to Aboki\tAboki is in Amdân. You should bring the furs to Aboki.\n",
[5642]="7001F3C1\n1\tCollect furled banners (total: 10)\tFlags stand among the ruins and valleys north-east of Dale Sageford's encampment. Dale Sageford remains at his encampment near the bridge over the Midgwater Pass. You should return to him when you have collected the flags from the ruins in the north-east as he asked.\n2\tBring the furled banners to Dale Sageford\tDale Sageford is at the hunter's camp, south-west of where you found the banners. You should return to Dale Sageford with the furled Orc-banners.\n",
[5643]="70058671\n1\tFind the dwarf-scout Borghild\tScout Borghild is somewhere in north-west Elderslade. Gunvald has asked you to bring orders to Borghild and lend what support you may.\n",
[5644]="7000B0FC\n1\tSpeak with Gelbes at Glân Vraig and complete a patrol through the Ettenmoors as a Ranger (Cost: 500 Commendations)\tGelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors. Speak with her to call a ranger to the Ettenmoors. The Rangers will assist in retaking Lugazag, but they request that you take the place of a Ranger in Eriador while they come to the Ettenmoors to fight in your stead. You should speak with Gelbes.\n2\tTalk to Gelbes\tGelbes is at Glân Vraig. A Ranger came to the Ettenmoors in your stead and fought valiantly, while you patrolled Eriador in their stead.\n",
[5645]="70000193\n1\tTalk to Fimreg\tFimreg is at Gath Forthnir, north and east of Myrkworth. Thorod has asked you to speak with Fimreg in Gath Forthnír. He is worried about his findings but will not say why.\n2\tSearch Urugarth for the creature poisoning the water\tUrugarth is to the west of Gath Forthnír and north of Imlad Balchorth. Fimreg believes that a large creature of some kind is poisoning the waters. If such a beast exists, proof of it will be found upstream in Urugarth.\n3\tBring the bony-hook to Fimreg\tFimreg is at Gath Forthnír, in eastern Himbar, east of Urugarth. You found a curious bony hook, like a claw or beak but not resembling part of any animal you have ever encountered before.\n",
[5646]="700494C3\n1\tDefeat foes at Fushaum Bal South (total: 6)\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should defeat those who dwell at Fushaum Bal South.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many foes at Fushaum Bal South.\n",
[5647]="70049422\n1\tDestroy tents at Fushaum Bal south (total: 8)\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should destroy tents in Fushaum Bal south.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed many tents at Fushaum Bal South.\n",
[5648]="700494C7\n1\tCollect tribute from those in Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tYou should collect tribute from those in Fushaum Bal North.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5649]="700494C9\n1\tChallenge those who oppose Khirgi\tA good place to challenge opposers can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should challenge those that would oppose Khirgi.\n2\tHold your ground and defeat the rowdy Haradrim\tYou should hold your ground! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5650]="700494B3\n1\tDefeat Mâlatuk's raiders (total: 2)\030Defeat Thâng's raiders (total: 2)\tThâng and Mâlatuk's raiders can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should defeat Thâng and Mâlatuk's raiders while avoiding the guards. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5651]="700494B6\n1\tSteal supplies from Fushaum Bal South (total: 8)\tSupplies can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should steal supplies from Fushaum Bal South while avoiding the guards. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5652]="700494C4\n1\tDefeat Shatúrro, the Spear\tShatúrro can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should defeat Shatúrro.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5653]="700494BA\n1\tDefeat Shatúrro's hunters (total: 4)\tShatúrro's hunters can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should defeat any hunters under the command of Shatúrro.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5654]="700494C0\n1\tCollect sûlok feed from the feed bag\tA feed bag can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should collect sûlok feed from the feed bag.\n2\tSûlokil can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should feed the sûlokil.\t\n3\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5655]="7004BEAB\n1\tDefeat Mâlatuk's raiders (total: 2)\030Defeat Thâng's raiders (total: 2)\tRaiders can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should defeat raiders while avoiding the guards. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to the Khundolar Commander\tThe Khundolar Commander can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to the Khundolar Commander.\n",
[5656]="7004942A\n1\tCollect stew from the cooking pot\tThe cooking pot can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should collect stew from the cooking pot.\n2\tNurnhoth slaves can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should give some stew to the Nurnhoth.\t\n3\tTalk to Thâng\tThâng can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Thâng.\n",
[5657]="70049428\n1\tDefeat foes at Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tFushaum Bal North is located in Talath Úrui. You should defeat those who dwell at Fushaum Bal North.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many foes at Fushaum Bal North.\n",
[5658]="700494B7\n1\tSteal food from Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tFood can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should steal food from Fushaum Bal North while avoiding the guards. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Thâng\tThâng can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Thâng.\n",
[5659]="700494BE\n1\tDestroy watch-towers at Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should destroy watch-towers in Fushaum Bal North.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed many watch-towers at Fushaum Bal North.\n",
[5660]="700494C8\n1\tDefeat Khirgi's Bridge Guards (total: 4)\tKhirgi's Bridge Guards can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should defeat the men guarding the bridge to Fushaum Bal North.\n2\tTalk to Mâlatuk\tMâlatuk can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Mâlatuk.\n",
[5661]="700494C6\n1\tDefeat Khirgi's loyal (total: 4)\tKhirgi's loyal can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should defeat Khirgi's loyal while avoiding the guards. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Mâlatuk\tMâlatuk can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Mâlatuk.\n",
[5662]="700494C5\n1\tDefeat Khirgi's Scouts (total: 4)\tKhirgi's Scouts can be found around Fushaum Bal. You should defeat any men scouting around Fushaum Bal.\n2\tTalk to Mâlatuk\tMâlatuk can be found at Fushaum Bal. You should talk to Mâlatuk.\n",
[5663]="700494C2\n1\tCount bandit stash (total: 8)\tThe Haradrim bandit chief's stash can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should count the stash for Thâng to make sure it is all there.\n2\tTalk to Thâng\tThâng can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Thâng.\n",
[5664]="700494B9\n1\tYou should bribe the poor in Fushaum Bal North.\t\n2\tTalk to Thâng\tThâng can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Thâng.\n",
})
